{"seq":4,"slug":"image-augmentation","title":"数据增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-fundamentals/image-augmentation","wordCount":1788,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据增强\">数据增强</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据增强通过对训练图像施加各种变换来人工扩大数据集规模和多样性，是深度学习中对抗过拟合、提升模型泛化能力的核心技术。正确使用数据增强通常能带来 2-5 个百分点的准确率提升，其效果往往超过更复杂的模型架构改进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始图像] --&gt; B{增强策略}&#10;    B --&gt; C[几何变换]&#10;    B --&gt; D[色彩扰动]&#10;    B --&gt; E[遮挡擦除]&#10;    B --&gt; F[混合增强]&#10;    C --&gt; G[翻转/旋转/裁剪]&#10;    D --&gt; H[亮度/对比度/饱和度]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Cutout/GridMask]&#10;    F --&gt; J[Mixup/CutMix]&#10;    G --&gt; K[增强后图像]&#10;    H --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph LR\n    A[原始图像] --&gt; B{增强策略}\n    B --&gt; C[几何变换]\n    B --&gt; D[色彩扰动]\n    B --&gt; E[遮挡擦除]\n    B --&gt; F[混合增强]\n    C --&gt; G[翻转/旋转/裁剪]\n    D --&gt; H[亮度/对比度/饱和度]\n    E --&gt; I[Cutout/GridMask]\n    F --&gt; J[Mixup/CutMix]\n    G --&gt; K[增强后图像]\n    H --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><p>数据增强的核心原则是保持语义不变性：变换后的图像应该保留原始标签的语义。例如，水平翻转一张猫的图片仍然是猫（语义不变），但如果是数字识别任务，翻转 &quot;6&quot; 会变成 &quot;9&quot;（语义改变），此时就不应使用翻转增强。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>增强类别</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>适用任务</th>\n<th>标签处理</th>\n<th>效果强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>几何变换</td>\n<td>翻转、旋转、缩放、裁剪</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>坐标同步变换</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩扰动</td>\n<td>亮度、对比度、饱和度、色调</td>\n<td>分类为主</td>\n<td>标签不变</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遮挡擦除</td>\n<td>Cutout, Random Erasing</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>标签不变</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合增强</td>\n<td>Mixup, CutMix, Mosaic</td>\n<td>分类/检测</td>\n<td>标签混合</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动搜索</td>\n<td>AutoAugment, RandAugment</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>依策略而定</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成增强</td>\n<td>GAN/Diffusion 生成</td>\n<td>数据稀缺场景</td>\n<td>需验证</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"几何变换增强\">几何变换增强</h2><p>几何变换是最基础也是最常用的数据增强方式。水平翻转（概率通常设为 0.5）几乎适用于所有自然图像任务，是成本最低的增强手段。随机裁剪（Random Crop）通过在图像中随机截取子区域来模拟不同的观察视角和尺度变化，同时迫使模型学习局部特征而非依赖全局布局。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torchvision import transforms&#10;&#10;train_transform = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(224, scale=(0.08, 1.0)),&#10;    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(p=0.5),&#10;    transforms.RandomRotation(degrees=15),&#10;    transforms.RandomAffine(degrees=0, translate=(0.1, 0.1), shear=10),&#10;    transforms.ToTensor(),&#10;    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406],&#10;                         std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225])&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomHorizontalFlip(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomRotation(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">degrees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomAffine(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">degrees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shear</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ToTensor(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                         std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在目标检测和实例分割任务中，几何变换必须同步应用于标注信息。翻转图像时，边界框的坐标也需要相应翻转；旋转图像时，边界框需要重新计算外接矩形。分割掩码需要与图像做完全相同的几何变换。这些同步操作在 Albumentations 等专业增强库中有完善的实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import albumentations as A&#10;&#10;det_transform = A.Compose([&#10;    A.HorizontalFlip(p=0.5),&#10;    A.RandomResizedCrop(640, 640, scale=(0.5, 1.0)),&#10;    A.Rotate(limit=15, border_mode=0),&#10;    A.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406], std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]),&#10;], bbox_params=A.BboxParams(format=&#39;pascal_voc&#39;, label_fields=[&#39;labels&#39;]))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> albumentations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">det_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> A.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A.HorizontalFlip(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A.RandomResizedCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A.Rotate(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">border_mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    A.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bbox_params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">A.BboxParams(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">format</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pascal_voc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label_fields</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'labels'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>随机缩放裁剪（RandomResizedCrop）是 ImageNet 训练的标准增强。它先随机确定裁剪区域的面积比（通常 0.08-1.0）和宽高比（通常 3/4-4/3），然后裁剪并缩放到目标尺寸。这种激进的裁剪策略迫使模型从部分信息中识别目标，极大增强了鲁棒性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色彩扰动与光照模拟\">色彩扰动与光照模拟</h2><p>色彩扰动通过随机调整图像的亮度、对比度、饱和度和色调来模拟不同的光照条件和拍摄设备差异。这类增强对于室外场景（光照变化大）和跨域迁移（不同相机色彩响应不同）特别有效。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torchvision import transforms&#10;&#10;color_transform = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.ColorJitter(&#10;        brightness=0.4,&#10;        contrast=0.4,&#10;        saturation=0.4,&#10;        hue=0.1&#10;    ),&#10;    transforms.RandomGrayscale(p=0.2),&#10;    transforms.GaussianBlur(kernel_size=23, sigma=(0.1, 2.0)),&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">color_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ColorJitter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        brightness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        contrast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        saturation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        hue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomGrayscale(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.GaussianBlur(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kernel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sigma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 色彩增强&#10;        A[原始图像] --&gt; B[亮度调整]&#10;        A --&gt; C[对比度调整]&#10;        A --&gt; D[饱和度调整]&#10;        A --&gt; E[色调偏移]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 高级光照&#10;        F[随机灰度化] --&gt; G[模拟灰度相机]&#10;        H[高斯模糊] --&gt; I[模拟失焦]&#10;        J[噪声注入] --&gt; K[模拟低光照]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 色彩增强\n        A[原始图像] --&gt; B[亮度调整]\n        A --&gt; C[对比度调整]\n        A --&gt; D[饱和度调整]\n        A --&gt; E[色调偏移]\n    end\n    subgraph 高级光照\n        F[随机灰度化] --&gt; G[模拟灰度相机]\n        H[高斯模糊] --&gt; I[模拟失焦]\n        J[噪声注入] --&gt; K[模拟低光照]\n    end</pre><p>随机灰度化（Random Grayscale）以一定概率将彩色图像转为灰度，迫使模型不过度依赖颜色信息。这在颜色不是关键判别因素的任务中很有效。高斯模糊模拟镜头失焦和运动模糊，增强模型对图像清晰度变化的鲁棒性。</p>\n<p>通道随机丢弃（Channel Dropout）和通道重排（Channel Shuffle）是更激进的色彩增强方式。通道丢弃将某个通道的值全部置零，强制模型利用剩余通道信息；通道重排打乱 RGB 通道顺序，防止模型对特定通道排列产生依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixup-与-cutmix-混合策略\">Mixup 与 CutMix 混合策略</h2><p>混合增强通过将两张或多张图像按照特定规则合成新的训练样本来扩展数据分布。这类方法不仅增加了数据多样性，还通过软标签训练起到了标签平滑的正则化效果。</p>\n<p>Mixup 对两张图像及其标签进行凸组合：<code>x_new = λ * x1 + (1-λ) * x2</code>，<code>y_new = λ * y1 + (1-λ) * y2</code>，其中 λ 从 Beta 分布中采样。Mixup 生成的半透明混合图像迫使模型学习更平滑的决策边界，对对抗样本也有一定的防御效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def mixup(images, labels, alpha=0.2):&#10;    lam = np.random.beta(alpha, alpha)&#10;    batch_size = images.size(0)&#10;    index = torch.randperm(batch_size)&#10;    mixed_images = lam * images + (1 - lam) * images[index]&#10;    return mixed_images, labels, labels[index], lam&#10;&#10;def cutmix(images, labels, alpha=1.0):&#10;    lam = np.random.beta(alpha, alpha)&#10;    batch_size, _, h, w = images.size()&#10;    index = torch.randperm(batch_size)&#10;    cut_ratio = np.sqrt(1.0 - lam)&#10;    cut_w = int(w * cut_ratio)&#10;    cut_h = int(h * cut_ratio)&#10;    cx = np.random.randint(w)&#10;    cy = np.random.randint(h)&#10;    x1 = np.clip(cx - cut_w // 2, 0, w)&#10;    y1 = np.clip(cy - cut_h // 2, 0, h)&#10;    x2 = np.clip(cx + cut_w // 2, 0, w)&#10;    y2 = np.clip(cy + cut_h // 2, 0, h)&#10;    images[:, :, y1:y2, x1:x2] = images[index, :, y1:y2, x1:x2]&#10;    lam = 1 - (x2 - x1) * (y2 - y1) / (w * h)&#10;    return images, labels, labels[index], lam\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mixup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(images, labels, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.beta(alpha, alpha)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images.size(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randperm(batch_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mixed_images </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lam) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images[index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mixed_images, labels, labels[index], lam</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cutmix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(images, labels, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c