span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randint(w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randint(h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(cx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cut_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(cy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cut_h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(cx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cut_w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.clip(cy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cut_h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    images[:, :, y1:y2, x1:x2] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images[index, :, y1:y2, x1:x2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x1) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (y2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y1) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> images, labels, labels[index], lam</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CutMix 将一张图像的矩形区域替换为另一张图像的对应区域，标签按面积比混合。相比 Mixup 的全局混合，CutMix 保留了更清晰的局部信息，在分类和检测任务中效果更好。Mosaic 增强将四张图像拼接成一张，是 YOLOv4 引入的检测任务专用增强策略，能在一次前向传播中看到更多小目标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>混合方式</th>\n<th>标签处理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mixup</td>\n<td>像素加权混合</td>\n<td>标签线性混合</td>\n<td>平滑决策边界</td>\n<td>混合图像不自然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CutMix</td>\n<td>矩形区域替换</td>\n<td>面积比混合</td>\n<td>保留局部信息</td>\n<td>可能切割关键区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mosaic</td>\n<td>四图拼接</td>\n<td>各图独立标注</td>\n<td>增加小目标密度</td>\n<td>仅适用于检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Copy-Paste</td>\n<td>实例粘贴</td>\n<td>粘贴实例标注</td>\n<td>增加实例多样性</td>\n<td>需要实例掩码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"autoaugment-与自动搜索\">AutoAugment 与自动搜索</h2><p>手动设计增强策略需要大量专业知识和实验调参。AutoAugment 将数据增强策略的选择形式化为搜索问题，通过强化学习或其他搜索算法自动找到最优的增强组合。</p>\n<p>AutoAugment 在一个包含 15 种基本变换和各自强度、概率的搜索空间中寻找最优策略。每个策略由多个子策略组成，每个子策略包含两个顺序执行的变换操作。搜索过程使用 PPO 强化学习算法，以验证集准确率作为奖励信号。AutoAugment 发现的策略在多个数据集上都超越了手工设计的增强方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torchvision import transforms&#10;&#10;auto_aug_transform = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(224),&#10;    transforms.AutoAugment(policy=transforms.AutoAugmentPolicy.IMAGENET),&#10;    transforms.ToTensor(),&#10;    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406],&#10;                         std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225])&#10;])&#10;&#10;rand_aug_transform = transforms.Compose([&#10;    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(224),&#10;    transforms.RandAugment(num_ops=2, magnitude=9),&#10;    transforms.ToTensor(),&#10;    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406],&#10;                         std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225])&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchvision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">auto_aug_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.AutoAugment(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">transforms.AutoAugmentPolicy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">IMAGENET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ToTensor(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                         std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rand_aug_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transforms.Compose([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandomResizedCrop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.RandAugment(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_ops</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">magnitude</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.ToTensor(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    transforms.Normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.485</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.406</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                         std</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.229</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.224</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.225</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RandAugment 大幅简化了搜索空间，只需要两个超参数：每次应用的变换数量 N 和变换强度 M。实验表明，这种简单的随机策略在大多数场景下与 AutoAugment 搜索出的复杂策略效果相当，而且无需昂贵的搜索过程。TrivialAugment 进一步将其简化为单个变换的随机选择，被证明是最具性价比的增强方案。</p>\n<p>在实际项目中，推荐的增强方案选择顺序是：首先使用基础的翻转+随机裁剪+色彩扰动，然后加入 RandAugment 或 TrivialAugment 作为自动增强，最后根据任务特点选择性加入 Mixup 或 CutMix。对于数据极度匮乏的场景，可以考虑使用生成模型（如 Stable Diffusion）合成训练数据作为补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((数据增强))&#10;    几何变换&#10;      翻转/旋转/裁剪&#10;      RandomResizedCrop&#10;      标注同步变换&#10;    色彩扰动&#10;      亮度/对比度/饱和度&#10;      灰度化/模糊&#10;      通道操作&#10;    混合策略&#10;      Mixup 像素混合&#10;      CutMix 区域替换&#10;      Mosaic 四图拼接&#10;    自动搜索&#10;      AutoAugment&#10;      RandAugment&#10;      TrivialAugment\">mindmap\n  root((数据增强))\n    几何变换\n      翻转/旋转/裁剪\n      RandomResizedCrop\n      标注同步变换\n    色彩扰动\n      亮度/对比度/饱和度\n      灰度化/模糊\n      通道操作\n    混合策略\n      Mixup 像素混合\n      CutMix 区域替换\n      Mosaic 四图拼接\n    自动搜索\n      AutoAugment\n      RandAugment\n      TrivialAugment</pre><ul>\n<li>数据增强是对抗过拟合最有效的正则化手段之一，通常能带来显著的性能提升</li>\n<li>几何变换增强需要同步处理标注信息，Albumentations 库提供了完善的支持</li>\n<li>混合增强（Mixup/CutMix）通过软标签训练带来额外的正则化效果</li>\n<li>RandAugment 和 TrivialAugment 以极低的调参成本达到了接近自动搜索的效果</li>\n<li>增强策略的选择应遵循语义不变性原则，避免破坏标签语义</li>\n<li>训练时使用增强，推理时不使用增强——这是数据增强的基本使用规则</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据增强","id":"数据增强"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"几何变换增强","id":"几何变换增强"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩扰动与光照模拟","id":"色彩扰动与光照模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"Mixup 与 CutMix 混合策略","id":"mixup-与-cutmix-混合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"AutoAugment 与自动搜索","id":"autoaugment-与自动搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"特征提取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-fundamentals/feature-extraction"},"next":{"title":"分类流水线设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/image-classification/classification-pipeline"}}